^{:go/end 480} (go/func tool "tool is a child (`arbace-box --store DIR --tool REQUEST`): the request's\nguest run under the tool's policy, its result put in the store and its\nhash written to standard output.  Exit status 1, with no result, when\nthe request cannot be run.\n" ^int [^string dir ^string reqHex]
