^{:go/end 511} (go/func imageAt "imageAt is ARBACE_BOX_IMAGE's guest (S7): the file p, or a blob of the\nstore in storeDir, named by its hash or as ref:NAME, its hash checked\nbefore the monitor maps it from the store's file.\n" [^string p ^string storeDir] :results [(* vmm/ImageFile) error]
